    "seed": 2026112301,
    "unit": "Paired whole-lineage bootstrap retaining all overlapping repeats and all models together; conditional on fits, not retraining."
  },
  "scope": "Elastic Net is the feature selector; downstream ridge isolates added-gene value against retained ridge. This is not a directly fitted genome-wide Elastic Net predictor or a TabPFN/NN refit.",
  "limitations": [
    "Previously inspected cohorts; exploratory discovery estimates despite nested selection controls.",
    "Fold-specific selection procedure is evaluated. A consensus list assembled across folds is not a separately validated fixed panel.",
    "Measured protein-coding RNA only; noncoding transcripts/DNA variants outside scope.",
    "Associations and overlapping-fold selection frequencies do not establish causality, independent replication or each gene incremental value.",
    "Original harmonized CTRP endpoint provenance limitations remain."
  ],
